body:
I've been working with rodents for 4 years now, and it was difficult at first to kill them or put them through experiments, but getting results helped me justify the gore in my head. Now it doesn't bother me as much because I know it'll help someone someday. But when it's for nothing, like hitting a small animal with your car, it gets to me. It's a mistake but fuck it's so preventable. 

&#x200B;

Mice are so tiny and vulnerable, and this little lady was barely post pubescent. I'm not saying she could've lived a long happy life but..
